'''Ancient Egg: N208''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Summer Break Cats (Event Gacha)|Summer Break Cats Event Gacha]]. It was added in [[Version 15.5 Update#Version 15.5.1 Update|Version 15.5.1]].

